    "turn_text": "Absolutely. And that's a great summary really for the book. I give tours regularly of the United States Capitol to constituents and to other groups that visit Washington DC. And I have studied the Capitol with historians and have gone online and learned a lot. And our history really is demonstrated in so many different features in the Capitol. And yet the progressives, the leftists, the radicals, the anarchists are trying to destroy the meaning of so many of those features. And it's sad to me to see that. And I think sad for many Americans who understand that the greatness of this country is based on the foundations that we see all around us in the Capitol.",
