    "turn_text": "Well, I shouldn't actually say that. And I probably shouldn't have put it in the book, but big government sucks. And it's just a You know, it is a bumper sticker that I've seen. It's a button that I've seen. And it really summarizes the problems that we have with the federal government. Our government was not designed to be a top-down government. It was designed to be a bottom-up government. It was designed to start with the people. school boards and town boards and other groups and then the states and then the federal government and the federal government has very specific and limited power and that has been abandoned and it's been abandoned to our detriment.",
