    "turn_idx": 21,
    "turn_text": "And reading that, I was just thinking, we're hearing all these cries to destroy our history, to tear down statues of George Washington. And I think people who think that sounds like a good idea have been told that our founding fathers and people like George Washington were elitists, or somehow that they weren't humble. But really, this is what we need to know that our country was really founded on great humility.",
