    "turn_text": "You're so right. And what a beautiful illustration, all of that potential was locked in him and getting rid of slavery was able to unleash that potential and you're right. It is such a beautiful symbol. You also talk about the rule of law and how our founding fathers viewed the rule of law and saw that it was so important to be governed by laws instead of by a monarch. Now we're seeing, but you've discussed the opposite. They considered if we don't have laws, we'll be ruled by mobs essentially. And now that's what we're facing in some cities and some areas. Can you talk a little bit about the importance of the rule of law?",
